msgstr "Ponovno pošlji"

msgid "Delete the selected entries?"
msgstr "Izbrisati izbrane vnose?"

msgid "Delete selected"
msgstr "Izbriši izbrane"

msgid "%1$s entries · deleted automatically after %2$s days"
msgstr "%1$s vnosov · samodejno izbrisano po %2$s dneh"

msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "Preverjanje…"

msgid "Sent. Check the inbox (and the spam folder) of the recipient."
msgstr ""
"Poslano. Preverite prejeto pošto (in mapo z neželeno pošto) prejemnika."

msgid "Not sent."
msgstr "Ni poslano."

msgid "open"
msgstr "odprto"

msgid "blocked"
msgstr "blokirano"

msgid "Request failed:"
msgstr "Zahteva ni uspela:"

msgid "Delivered through:"
msgstr "Dostavljeno prek:"

msgid "You do not have sufficient permissions to access this page."
msgstr "Nimate zadostnih dovoljenj za dostop do te strani."

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve"

msgid "Test & diagnostics"
msgstr "Preizkus in diagnostika"

msgid "Email log"
msgstr "Dnevnik e-pošte"

msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "Povratne informacije"

msgid "About"
msgstr "O programu"

msgid ""
"Send every WordPress email through your own SMTP server — with an email log,"
" resend, a backup connection and failure alerts. All free, no upsells."
msgstr ""
"Pošiljajte vso WordPress e-pošto prek svojega SMTP strežnika — z dnevnikom "
"e-pošte, ponovnim pošiljanjem, rezervno povezavo in opozorili ob napakah. "
"Vse brezplačno, brez dodatnih ponudb."

msgid "The email was sent again."
msgstr "E-pošta je bila ponovno poslana."

msgid ""
"The email could not be sent again — see the newest log entry for the reason."
msgstr ""
"E-pošte ni bilo mogoče ponovno poslati — za razlog glejte najnovejši vnos v "
"dnevniku."

msgid "The content of this email was not kept, so it cannot be resent."
msgstr ""
"Vsebina te e-pošte ni bila shranjena, zato je ni mogoče ponovno poslati."

msgid "Log entries deleted."
msgstr "Vnosi v dnevniku so bili izbrisani."

msgid ""
"Settings imported. Enter the SMTP password once and save — passwords are "
"never copied from other plugins."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitve so bile uvožene. Enkrat vnesite geslo SMTP in shranite — gesla se"
" nikoli ne kopirajo iz drugih vtičnikov."

msgid "Set in wp-config.php"
msgstr "Nastavljeno v wp-config.php"

msgid "Email is sent through %1$s on port %2$s."
msgstr "E-pošta se pošilja prek %1$s na vratih %2$s."

msgid ""
"No SMTP server set yet — WordPress still sends with PHP mail(). Pick your "
"provider below, fill in the login and save."
msgstr ""
"SMTP strežnik še ni nastavljen — WordPress še vedno pošilja prek PHP mail()."
" Spodaj izberite ponudnika, vnesite prijavne podatke in shranite."

msgid "Delivery is switched off: emails are logged but not sent."
msgstr "Pošiljanje je izklopljeno: e-pošta se beleži, vendar se ne pošilja."

msgid "Test mode: every email goes to %s instead of its recipients."
msgstr "Način preizkusa: vsaka e-pošta gre namesto prejemnikom na %s."

msgid ""
"The saved password can no longer be read because the site's security keys "
"changed. Enter it again and save."
msgstr ""
"Shranjeno geslo ni več berljivo, ker so se varnostni ključi spletnega mesta "
"spremenili. Vnesite ga znova in shranite."

msgid "Last failure %1$s ago: %2$s"
msgstr "Zadnja napaka pred %1$s: %2$s"

msgid "Show failed emails"
msgstr "Pokaži neuspešno poslana e-poštna sporočila"

msgid ""
"Also active: %s. Two mail plugins fight over the same email — deactivate the"
" other one."
msgstr ""
"Tudi aktivno: %s. Dva poštna vtičnika se spopadata za isto e-pošto — "
"deaktivirajte drugega."

msgid "Import settings from %s"
msgstr "Uvozi nastavitve iz %s"

msgid "SMTP server"
msgstr "SMTP strežnik"

msgid "Provider"
msgstr "Ponudnik"

msgid "Port and encryption"
msgstr "Vrata in šifriranje"

msgid "TLS (STARTTLS) — usually port 587"
msgstr "TLS (STARTTLS) — običajno vrata 587"

msgid "SSL — usually port 465"
msgstr "SSL — običajno vrata 465"

msgid "None — only for a server on the same network"
msgstr "Brez — samo za strežnik v istem omrežju"

msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "Preverjanje pristnosti"

msgid "The server needs a username and password (almost always)"
msgstr "Strežnik potrebuje uporabniško ime in geslo (skoraj vedno)"

msgid ""
"The password comes from LYNBRO_SMTP_PASS in wp-config.php and is not stored "
"in the database."
msgstr ""
"Geslo prihaja iz LYNBRO_SMTP_PASS v wp-config.php in se ne shrani v zbirko "
"podatkov."

msgid "Saved — leave empty to keep it"
msgstr "Shranjeno — pustite prazno, da ohranite obstoječe"

msgid "Remove the saved password"
msgstr "Odstrani shranjeno geslo"

msgid ""
"Stored encrypted with your site's security keys and never shown again. To "
"keep it out of the database entirely, define it in wp-config.php (see "
"About)."
msgstr ""
"Shranjeno šifrirano z varnostnimi ključi vašega spletnega mesta in nikoli "
"več prikazano. Če ga želite povsem izključiti iz zbirke podatkov, ga "
"definirajte v wp-config.php (glejte O programu)."

msgid "Certificate"
msgstr "Potrdilo"

msgid "Verify the server certificate"
msgstr "Preveri potrdilo strežnika"

msgid "Default"
msgstr "Privzeto"

msgid "Untick only for your own server with a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "Odznačite le za svoj strežnik s samopodpisanim potrdilom."

msgid "Sender"
msgstr "Pošiljatelj"

msgid "Force this address on every email, whatever other plugins set"
msgstr ""
"Vsili ta naslov v vsako e-pošto, ne glede na to, kaj nastavijo drugi "
"vtičniki"

msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Priporočeno"

msgid ""
"Use an address on a domain your SMTP account may send for, or providers "
"reject or spam-folder the email."
msgstr ""
"Uporabite naslov na domeni, s katere sme vaš račun SMTP pošiljati, sicer "
"ponudniki e-pošto zavrnejo ali jo označijo kot neželeno pošto."

msgid "Force this name too (off: forms and shops keep their own sender name)"
msgstr ""
"Vsili tudi to ime (izklopljeno: obrazci in trgovine ohranijo svoje ime "
"pošiljatelja)"

msgid "Default Reply-To"
msgstr "Privzeti odgovor na"

msgid ""
"Used only when an email has no Reply-To of its own, so contact-form replies "
"still go to the visitor."
msgstr ""
"Uporabi se le, kadar e-pošta nima svojega odgovora na, zato odgovori na "
"kontaktni obrazec še vedno pridejo obiskovalcu."

msgid "Return-Path"
msgstr "Return-Path"

msgid "Send bounces to the From address"
msgstr "Pošlji nedostavljiva sporočila na naslov From"

msgid "Backup connection"
msgstr "Rezervna povezava"

msgid ""
"When the main server fails, the same email is sent again through the backup "
"at once — the visitor never sees an error."
msgstr ""
"Ko glavni strežnik odpove, se ista e-pošta takoj pošlje znova prek "
"rezervnega strežnika — obiskovalec nikoli ne vidi napake."

msgid "Backup"
msgstr "Rezervno"

msgid "Use a backup when the main server fails"
msgstr "Uporabi rezervno povezavo, ko glavni strežnik odpove"

msgid "Another SMTP server"
msgstr "Drug SMTP strežnik"

msgid "PHP mail() of this server (better than nothing; may land in spam)"
msgstr ""
"PHP mail() tega strežnika (bolje kot nič; lahko pristane v neželeni pošti)"

msgid "Backup host"
msgstr "Rezervni gostitelj"

msgid "Backup port"
msgstr "Rezervna vrata"

msgid "Backup encryption"
msgstr "Rezervno šifriranje"

msgid "None"
msgstr "Brez"

msgid "Backup login"
msgstr "Rezervna prijava"

msgid "Backup password"
msgstr "Rezervno geslo"

msgid "Delivery mode"
msgstr "Način dostave"

msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Način"

msgid "Send normally"
msgstr "Pošlji običajno"

msgid "Test mode: send everything to one address (Cc and Bcc are dropped)"
msgstr "Preizkusni način: vse pošlji na en naslov (Cc in Bcc se odstranita)"

msgid "Redirect address"
msgstr "Preusmeritveni naslov"

msgid "Do not send any email (staging copies) — emails are still logged"
msgstr ""
"Ne pošiljaj nobene e-pošte (staging kopije) — e-pošta je še vedno zabeležena"

msgid "Log"
msgstr "Dnevnik"

msgid "Keep a log of every email (recipient, subject, status, error)"
msgstr "Hrani dnevnik vsake e-pošte (prejemnik, zadeva, stanje, napaka)"

msgid "Keep message content"
msgstr "Obdrži vsebino sporočila"

msgid "Only of failed emails, so they can be resent"
msgstr "Samo pri neuspešno poslanih e-poštah, da jih je mogoče znova poslati"

msgid ""
"Of every email (lets you resend anything; the log then holds password-reset "
"links and order details)"
msgstr ""
"Pri vsaki e-pošti (omogoča ponovno pošiljanje česarkoli; dnevnik nato "
"vsebuje povezave za ponastavitev gesla in podrobnosti naročila)"

msgid "Never"
msgstr "Nikoli"

msgid "Keep entries for"
msgstr "Hrani vnose"

msgid "days, then they are deleted automatically"
msgstr "dni, nato se samodejno izbrišejo"

msgid "Failure alerts"
msgstr "Opozorila ob napakah"

msgid ""
"At most one alert per hour. The alert email is sent with PHP mail() of this "
"server, because the SMTP server may be the thing that is down."
msgstr ""
"Največ eno opozorilo na uro. Opozorilna e-pošta se pošlje z uporabo PHP "
"mail() tega strežnika, ker je lahko prav SMTP strežnik tisti, ki ne deluje."

msgid "Alert email"
msgstr "E-pošta za opozorila"

msgid "Webhook URL"
msgstr "URL spletnega kavlja"

msgid ""
"Optional. Slack, Discord, Microsoft Teams workflows, ntfy or your own "
"endpoint (HTTPS). The plugin posts the error text there — nothing else, and "
"only when you set a URL."
msgstr ""
"Neobvezno. Poteki dela za Slack, Discord, Microsoft Teams, ntfy ali vaš "
"lastni končni naslov (HTTPS). Vtičnik tja pošlje samo besedilo napake — nič "
"drugega, in to le, ko nastavite URL."

msgid "Import from another SMTP plugin"
msgstr "Uvozi iz drugega SMTP vtičnika"

msgid ""
"Copies host, port, encryption, username and sender. Passwords stay where "
"they are — enter yours once after importing."
msgstr ""
"Kopira gostitelja, vrata, šifriranje, uporabniško ime in pošiljatelja. Gesla"
" ostanejo tam, kjer so — svoje vnesite enkrat po uvozu."

msgid "Import from %s"
msgstr "Uvozi iz %s"

msgid ""
"No settings of WP Mail SMTP, FluentSMTP, Easy WP SMTP or Post SMTP were "
"found on this site."
msgstr ""
"Na tem spletnem mestu niso bile najdene nastavitve vtičnikov WP Mail SMTP, "
"FluentSMTP, Easy WP SMTP ali Post SMTP."

msgid "Download the log (CSV)"
msgstr "Prenesi dnevnik (CSV)"

msgid "Delete every log entry?"
msgstr "Izbrišete vse vnose dnevnika?"

msgid "Empty the log"
msgstr "Počisti dnevnik"

msgid "Is it working for you?"
msgstr "Ali vam deluje?"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP is free, with nothing locked. If it got your email delivered, a "
"short review helps other people find it."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP je brezplačen, brez zaklenjenih funkcij. Če je poskrbel za "
"dostavo vaše e-pošte, bo kratka ocena pomagala drugim, da ga najdejo."

msgid "Leave a review on WordPress.org"
msgstr "Pustite oceno na WordPress.org"

msgid "Something missing or broken?"
msgstr "Kaj manjka ali ne deluje?"

msgid ""
"Bug reports and ideas are read by the people who build the plugin. Opening "
"these links sends nothing from your site."
msgstr ""
"Poročila o napakah in ideje berejo ljudje, ki razvijajo vtičnik. Odpiranje "
"teh povezav ne pošlje ničesar z vašega spletnega mesta."

msgid "Ask in the support forum"
msgstr "Vprašajte na forumu za podporo"

msgid "Suggest a feature (public roadmap)"
msgstr "Predlagajte funkcijo (javni načrt razvoja)"

msgid ""
"Posting a log line? Remove addresses first — the Test tab already hides the "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Objavljate vrstico dnevnika? Najprej odstranite naslove — zavihek Test že "
"skrije geslo."

msgid "You do not have permission to do that."
msgstr "Nimate dovoljenja za to dejanje."

msgid "Enter a valid recipient address."
msgstr "Vnesite veljaven naslov prejemnika."

msgid ""
"%1$s: the main SMTP connection failed and the backup delivered the email. "
"Error: %2$s"
msgstr ""
"%1$s: glavna SMTP povezava ni uspela in varnostna kopija je dostavila "
"e-pošto. Napaka: %2$s"

msgid "%1$s: an email could not be sent. Error: %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s: e-pošte ni bilo mogoče poslati. Napaka: %2$s"

msgid "Log entry #%d"
msgstr "Vnos dnevnika #%d"

msgid "[%s] Email delivery problem"
msgstr "[%s] Težava pri dostavi e-pošte"

msgid "Email delivery"
msgstr "Dostava e-pošte"

msgid "Email is sent through SMTP"
msgstr "E-pošta se pošilja prek SMTP"

msgid "Email"
msgstr "E-pošta"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP sends this site's email through an authenticated SMTP server."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP pošilja e-pošto tega spletnega mesta prek overjenega strežnika "
"SMTP."

msgid "Open Lynbro SMTP"
msgstr "Odpri Lynbro SMTP"

msgid "Email is sent with PHP mail(), not SMTP"
msgstr "E-pošta se pošilja s PHP mail(), ne prek SMTP"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP is active but no SMTP server is set, so email still leaves "
"through PHP mail() and often lands in spam."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP je aktiven, vendar ni nastavljen noben strežnik SMTP, zato se "
"e-pošta še vedno pošilja prek PHP mail() in pogosto pristane v neželeni "
"pošti."

msgid "The saved SMTP password can no longer be read"
msgstr "Shranjeno geslo SMTP ni več berljivo"

msgid ""
"The site's security keys changed after the password was saved. Enter the "
"SMTP password again."
msgstr ""
"Varnostni ključi spletnega mesta so se po shranitvi gesla spremenili. Geslo "
"SMTP vnesite znova."

msgid "Emails failed to send in the last 24 hours"
msgstr "V zadnjih 24 urah e-pošte ni bilo mogoče poslati"

msgid "The main SMTP connection failed in the last 24 hours"
msgstr "Glavna SMTP povezava v zadnjih 24 urah ni uspela"

msgid "Email delivery (7 days)"
msgstr "Dostava e-pošte (7 dni)"

msgid "Sent: %1$s · Failed: %2$s"
msgstr "Poslano: %1$s · Neuspešno: %2$s"

msgid "No SMTP server is set yet — email is sent with PHP mail()."
msgstr "SMTP strežnik še ni nastavljen — e-pošta se pošilja s PHP mail()."

msgid "Show failed"
msgstr "Prikaži neuspešne"

msgid "Main connection: %1$s — Backup connection: %2$s"
msgstr "Glavna povezava: %1$s — Varnostna kopija: %2$s"

msgid "Test email from %s"
msgstr "Testna e-pošta iz %s"

msgid ""
"This is a test email from %1$s, sent by Lynbro SMTP.\n"
"\n"
"If you can read it, email delivery works.\n"
"\n"
"Sent: %2$s\n"
"Connection: %3$s"
msgstr ""
"To je testna e-pošta iz %1$s, poslana prek Lynbro SMTP.\n"
"\n"
"Če jo lahko preberete, dostava e-pošte deluje.\n"
"\n"
"Poslano: %2$s\n"
"Povezava: %3$s"

msgid "backup"
msgstr "varnostna kopija"

msgid "main"
msgstr "glavno"

msgid ""
"The server refused the username or password. Gmail, Outlook, Zoho and iCloud"
" need an app password, not the normal one; SendGrid and Brevo need an "
"SMTP/API key."
msgstr ""
"Strežnik je zavrnil uporabniško ime ali geslo. Gmail, Outlook, Zoho in "
"iCloud potrebujejo geslo za aplikacijo, ne običajnega; SendGrid in Brevo "
"potrebujeta ključ SMTP/API."

msgid ""
"Microsoft 365 has SMTP sign-in switched off for this mailbox. An "
"administrator can enable \"Authenticated SMTP\" for it, or use a relay "
"service instead."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft 365 ima za to poštno predalnico izklopljeno prijavo prek SMTP. "
"Skrbnik lahko omogoči »Preverjeni SMTP«, ali pa uporabite storitev za "
"posredovanje."

msgid ""
"The server could not be reached. Many hosts block outgoing ports 25, 465 and"
" 587 — run the port check below, then ask your host to open the port or use "
"the one that is open."
msgstr ""
"Strežnika ni bilo mogoče doseči. Mnogi gostitelji blokirajo izhodna vrata "
"25, 465 in 587 — izvedite spodnji preizkus vrat, nato pa prosite gostitelja,"
" naj odpre vrata, ali uporabite tista, ki so odprta."

msgid ""
"The secure connection failed. Check that port and encryption match (587 = "
"TLS, 465 = SSL). If the server uses a self-signed certificate, untick "
"\"Verify the server certificate\"."
msgstr ""
"Varna povezava ni uspela. Preverite, ali se vrata in šifriranje ujemajo (587"
" = TLS, 465 = SSL). Če strežnik uporablja samopodpisano potrdilo, odznačite "
"»Preveri potrdilo strežnika«."

msgid ""
"The server does not let this account send as the From address. Use an "
"address on a domain the account owns, and switch on \"Force From email\"."
msgstr ""
"Strežnik temu računu ne dovoli pošiljanja kot naslov From. Uporabite naslov "
"v domeni, ki je v lasti računa, in vklopite »Vsili naslov From«."

msgid "The host name does not resolve. Check it for typos."
msgstr ""
"Ime gostitelja ni razrešeno. Preverite, ali je v njem tipkarska napaka."

msgid ""
"Read the last SERVER lines of the transcript: the server usually says "
"exactly what it did not like."
msgstr ""
"Preberite zadnje VRSTICE SERVER v prepisu: strežnik običajno natančno pove, "
"česa ni sprejel."

msgid "No host set."
msgstr "Gostitelj ni nastavljen."

msgid "That log entry no longer exists."
msgstr "Ta zapis dnevnika ne obstaja več."

msgid ""
"The content of this email was not kept, so it cannot be resent. Change "
"\"Keep message content\" in Settings to resend future emails."
msgstr ""
"Vsebina tega e-poštnega sporočila ni bila shranjena, zato ga ni mogoče znova"
" poslati. Spremenite »Obdrži vsebino sporočila« v Nastavitvah, da boste "
"lahko znova poslali prihodnja e-poštna sporočila."

msgid ""
"The email could not be sent again. The new attempt and its error are in the "
"log."
msgstr ""
"E-poštnega sporočila ni bilo mogoče znova poslati. Nov poskus in njegova "
"napaka sta v dnevniku."

msgid "Date (UTC)"
msgstr "Datum (UTC)"

msgid "Recipients"
msgstr "Prejemniki"

msgid "Lynbro SMTP email log"
msgstr "Dnevnik e-pošte Lynbro SMTP"

msgid ""
"The rest of the suite. What is already on this site is marked; nothing "
"installs without you asking for it."
msgstr ""
"Preostali del zbirke. Kar je že na tem spletnem mestu, je označeno; nič se "
"ne namesti brez vašega dovoljenja."

msgid "Active"
msgstr "Aktivno"

msgid "Activate"
msgstr "Aktiviraj"

msgid "Install now"
msgstr "Namesti zdaj"

msgid "View on WordPress.org"
msgstr "Ogled na WordPress.org"

msgid ""
"Shared Lynbro components v%1$s, provided by %2$s (newest of %3$d versions on"
" this site)."
msgstr ""
"Deljene komponente Lynbro v%1$s, ki jih zagotavlja %2$s (najnovejše od %3$d "
"različic na tem spletnem mestu)."

msgid "Reset all settings to defaults?"
msgstr "Ponastaviti vse nastavitve na privzete?"

msgid ""
"Is Lynbro SMTP getting your email delivered? A few words on WordPress.org "
"help others find a mail plugin without upsells."
msgstr ""
"Ali Lynbro SMTP skrbi za dostavo vaše e-pošte? Nekaj besed na WordPress.org "
"pomaga drugim najti poštni vtičnik brez vsiljene prodaje."

msgid "Write a review"
msgstr "Napiši oceno"

msgid "No thanks"
msgstr "Ne, hvala"

msgid ""
"Redirect mode needs an address to redirect to — mail is sent normally until "
"you add one."
msgstr ""
"Način preusmerjanja potrebuje naslov za preusmeritev — pošta se pošilja "
"normalno, dokler ga ne dodate."

msgid "Other SMTP server"
msgstr "Drug SMTP-strežnik"

msgid "Use the SMTP details from your host or email provider."
msgstr ""
"Uporabite podrobnosti SMTP od vašega gostitelja ali ponudnika e-pošte."

msgid ""
"Username: your full Gmail address. Password: an app password (Google Account"
" → Security → 2-Step Verification → App passwords), not your normal "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Uporabniško ime: vaš polni naslov Gmail. Geslo: geslo za aplikacijo (Google "
"Račun → Varnost → Preverjanje v dveh korakih → Gesla za aplikacije), ne vaše"
" običajno geslo."

msgid ""
"Microsoft 365 needs \"Authenticated SMTP\" enabled for the mailbox. "
"Microsoft is retiring password sign-in for SMTP; if login fails, use a relay"
" service such as Brevo or your host's SMTP."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft 365 potrebuje omogočen »Preverjeni SMTP« za poštni predal. "
"Microsoft opušča prijavo z geslom za SMTP; če prijava ne uspe, uporabite "
"storitev za posredovanje, kot je Brevo, ali SMTP vašega gostitelja."

msgid ""
"Username: the SMTP login shown under SMTP & API. Password: an SMTP key, not "
"your account password."
msgstr ""
"Uporabniško ime: prijava SMTP, prikazana pod SMTP & API. Geslo: ključ SMTP, "
"ne geslo vašega računa."

msgid "Username: the word \"apikey\". Password: your SendGrid API key."
msgstr "Uporabniško ime: beseda »apikey«. Geslo: vaš ključ API SendGrid."

msgid ""
"EU accounts use smtp.eu.mailgun.org. Username and password: the SMTP "
"credentials of your sending domain."
msgstr ""
"Računi EU uporabljajo smtp.eu.mailgun.org. Uporabniško ime in geslo: "
"poverilnice SMTP vaše pošiljateljske domene."

msgid ""
"Change the region in the host to yours. Username and password: SMTP "
"credentials created in the SES console (not your AWS access keys)."
msgstr ""
"Spremenite regijo v gostitelju na svojo. Uporabniško ime in geslo: "
"poverilnice SMTP, ustvarjene v konzoli SES (ne vaše dostopne ključe AWS)."

msgid "Username and password: both are your Server API token."
msgstr "Uporabniško ime in geslo: oboje je vaš žeton Server API."

msgid ""
"Use smtp.zoho.com for accounts outside the EU. With two-factor sign-in, "
"create an app-specific password."
msgstr ""
"Uporabite smtp.zoho.com za račune zunaj EU. Pri prijavi z dvofaktorsko "
"avtentikacijo ustvarite geslo za posamezno aplikacijo."

msgid "Username: API key. Password: secret key."
msgstr "Uporabniško ime: ključ API. Geslo: skrivni ključ."

msgid ""
"Username and password: an SMTP user created under Sending → SMTP Users."
msgstr ""
"Uporabniško ime in geslo: uporabnik SMTP, ustvarjen pod Pošiljanje → "
"Uporabniki SMTP."

msgid "Username: the full mailbox address. Password: the mailbox password."
msgstr ""
"Uporabniško ime: polni naslov poštnega predala. Geslo: geslo poštnega "
"predala."

msgid ""
"Use smtp.ionos.de or smtp.ionos.co.uk for those regions. Username: the full "
"mailbox address."
msgstr ""
"Za te regije uporabite smtp.ionos.de ali smtp.ionos.co.uk. Uporabniško ime: "
"polni naslov poštnega predala."

msgid "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp"
msgstr "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp"

msgid ""
"Sends all WordPress email through your own SMTP server, with a searchable "
"email log, resend, a backup connection, failure alerts and connection "
"diagnostics. No upsells."
msgstr ""
"Pošilja vsa WordPress e-poštna sporočila prek vašega lastnega strežnika "
"SMTP, z iskalnim dnevnikom e-pošte, ponovnim pošiljanjem, varnostno "
"povezavo, opozorili o napakah in diagnostiko povezave. Brez dodatnih ponudb."

msgid "lynbro aps"
msgstr "lynbro aps"

msgid "https://lynbro.dk"
msgstr "https://lynbro.dk"

msgid ""
"Host: the SMTP endpoint of your SES region, shown in the SES console under "
"SMTP settings. Username and password: SMTP credentials created in the SES "
"console (not your AWS access keys)."
msgstr ""
"Gostitelj: končna točka SMTP za vašo regijo SES, prikazana v konzoli SES v "
"nastavitvah SMTP. Uporabniško ime in geslo: poverilnice SMTP, ustvarjene v "
"konzoli SES (ne vaši ključi za dostop do AWS)."

msgid "Lynbro SMTP Mailer"
msgstr "Lynbro SMTP Mailer"

msgid "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp-mailer"
msgstr "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp-mailer"

msgid "LynBro ApS"
msgstr "LynBro ApS"

msgid ""
"Optional. A Slack or Discord incoming webhook, or your own HTTPS endpoint "
"(JSON with \"text\" and \"content\"). The plugin posts the error text there "
"— nothing else, and only when you set a URL."
msgstr ""
"Neobvezno. Prihodni webhook za Slack ali Discord ali vaš lasten HTTPS končni"
" naslov (JSON z \"text\" in \"content\"). Vtičnik tja pošlje besedilo napake"
" — nič drugega, in to samo, ko nastavite URL."

msgid "Is %s doing its job?"
msgstr "Ali %s opravlja svoje delo?"

msgid ""
"You have used it for a couple of weeks now. If it works for you, a short "
"review on WordPress.org helps other site owners find it — honest ones, "
"critical ones included."
msgstr ""
"Uporabljate ga že nekaj tednov. Če vam ustreza, kratka ocena na "
"WordPress.org pomaga drugim lastnikom strani, da ga najdejo — tudi iskrene "
"in kritične."

msgid ""
"You have used it for a couple of weeks now. If it works for you — or if "
"something is missing — tell us on our public roadmap. That is how we decide "
"what to build next."
msgstr ""
"Uporabljate ga že nekaj tednov. Če vam ustreza — ali če kaj manjka — nam to "
"sporočite na našem javnem načrtu razvoja. Tako odločamo, kaj bomo razvijali "
"naslednje."

msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(odpre se v novem zavihku)"

msgid "Share feedback"
msgstr "Pošlji povratne informacije"

msgid "Maybe later"
msgstr "Morda kasneje"

msgid "Don't ask again"
msgstr "Ne sprašuj več"

msgid "Something not working? Ask for help"
msgstr "Nekaj ne deluje? Prosite za pomoč"

msgid "WooCommerce is active"
msgstr "WooCommerce je aktiven"

msgid "a form plugin is active"
msgstr "vtičnik za obrazce je aktiven"

msgid "the site is set up for Denmark"
msgstr "spletno mesto je nastavljeno za Dansko"

msgid "comments are open"
msgstr "komentarji so odprti"

msgid "tracking tags are active"
msgstr "sledilne oznake so aktivne"

msgid "visitors can create accounts"
msgstr "obiskovalci lahko ustvarijo račune"

msgid "Suggested because %l."
msgstr "Predlagano zaradi %l."

msgid "Suggested for this site"
msgstr "Predlagano za to spletno mesto"

msgid "Hide suggestions"
msgstr "Skrij predloge"

msgid ""
"Other Lynbro plugins that fit what this site uses. Nothing is installed "
"unless you click."
msgstr ""
"Drugi Lynbro vtičniki, ki ustrezajo uporabi tega mesta. Nič ni nameščeno, "
"dokler ne kliknete."

msgid "All Lynbro plugins"
msgstr "Vsi Lynbro vtičniki"

msgid ""
"Picked from what this site already uses — read on this site, nothing is sent"
" anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Izbrano glede na to, kar to spletno mesto že uporablja — prebrano na tem "
"mestu, nič se ne pošlje nikamor."

msgid "Image Optimizer"
msgstr "Optimizator slik"

msgid ""
"Convert to WebP and AVIF, right-size oversized images and lazy-load them — "
"all on your own server."
msgstr ""
"Pretvorite slike v WebP in AVIF, prilagodite prevelike slike in omogočite "
"leno nalaganje — vse na lastnem strežniku."

msgid "AI Studio"
msgstr "AI Studio"

msgid ""
"Write and illustrate posts with AI on your own OpenAI key — at cost, with no"
" credits in between."
msgstr ""
"Pišite in ilustrirajte objave z umetno inteligenco na lastnem OpenAI ključu "
"— po stroškovni ceni, brez posrednikov."

msgid "Analytics"
msgstr "Analitika"

msgid ""
"Self-hosted, cookieless analytics with funnels. Visitor data never leaves "
"your database."
msgstr ""
"Lastna, brezpiškotna analitika s prodajnimi lijaki. Podatki obiskovalcev "
"nikoli ne zapustijo vaše baze."

msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Oznake"

msgid ""
"GA4, Tag Manager, Google Ads, Meta Pixel and more without code — each tag "
"waits for consent."
msgstr ""
"GA4, Tag Manager, Google Ads, Meta Pixel in več brez kode — vsaka oznaka "
"počaka na soglasje."

msgid "Forms"
msgstr "Obrazci"

msgid ""
"Forms with entries saved for free and no cap, conditional logic checked "
"server-side, and signed webhooks."
msgstr ""
"Obrazci z brezplačno shranjevanjem vnosov brez omejitev, pogojna logika na "
"strežniku in podpisani spletni klici."

msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Preveri"

msgid ""
"Catch mistyped e-mail domains and bad phone numbers, and confirm them with a"
" one-time code by e-mail or SMS."
msgstr ""
"Zaznajte napačne e-poštne domene in slabe telefonske številke ter jih "
"potrdite z enkratno kodo po e-pošti ali SMS-u."

msgid "Cache"
msgstr "Predpomnilnik"

msgid ""
"Reliable purging for an nginx FastCGI cache and a Redis object cache, with "
"every purge verified against the cache itself."
msgstr ""
"Zanesljivo čiščenje za nginx FastCGI in Redis objektni predpomnilnik, vsako "
"čiščenje preverjeno neposredno v predpomnilniku."

msgid "Translate"
msgstr "Prevedi"

msgid ""
"Run your site in several languages, with machine translation on your own "
"OpenAI key — nothing metered, nothing sold by the word."
msgstr ""
"Vaša stran v več jezikih, s strojno prevajanje na lastnem OpenAI ključu — "
"brez omejitev, brez prodaje po besedah."

msgid "Shield"
msgstr "Zaščita"

msgid ""
"Security headers, HTTPS with HSTS, a small firewall against injection probes"
" and the hardening switches every site needs."
msgstr ""
"Varnostne glave, HTTPS s HSTS, majhen požarni zid proti vdorom in ključna "
"utrjevalna stikala za vsako stran."

msgid "Anti-Spam"
msgstr "Protispam"

msgid ""
"Spam checks that run on your own server. No account, no subscription, every "
"block says why — and a held message is never lost."
msgstr ""
"Protispam preverjanja na vašem strežniku. Brez računa, brez naročnine, vsak "
"blokiran primer z razlogom — in nobeno zadržano sporočilo ni izgubljeno."

msgid "Login Guard"
msgstr "Varna prijava"

msgid ""
"Move wp-login.php, limit failed sign-ins and add app-based two-factor — with"
" three ways back in."
msgstr ""
"Premaknite wp-login.php, omejite neuspešne prijave in dodajte dvostopenjsko "
"preverjanje — s tremi možnostmi za dostop."

msgid "Cookie Consent"
msgstr "Soglasje za piškotke"

msgid ""
"A GDPR and ePrivacy banner with Consent Mode v2, an equally prominent Reject"
" button and 35 languages."
msgstr ""
"GDPR in ePrivacy pasica z načinom soglasja v2, enako vidnim gumbom za "
"zavrnitev in 35 jeziki."

msgid "Activity Log"
msgstr "Dnevnik dejavnosti"

msgid ""
"Who did what, when and from where — written down on your own server, "
"searchable, exportable, and deleted on your schedule."
msgstr ""
"Kdo je kaj, kdaj in od kod naredil — zapisano na vašem strežniku, iskalno, "
"izvozljivo in izbrisano po vašem urniku."

msgid "Data Retention"
msgstr "Hramba podatkov"

msgid ""
"Find where personal data actually sits in your database, then delete it on a"
" schedule — with a dry run before every deletion."
msgstr ""
"Poiščite, kje so osebni podatki v vaši bazi, nato jih izbrišite po urniku — "
"z možnostjo preizkusa pred vsakim brisanjem."

msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Dostopnost"

msgid ""
"Scan every page against WCAG 2.2 AA and fix what can be fixed safely. No "
"overlay, no page limit."
msgstr ""
"Preverite vsako stran glede na WCAG 2.2 AA in popravite, kar je varno "
"mogoče. Brez prekrivanja, brez omejitve strani."

msgid "SEO"
msgstr "SEO"

msgid ""
"Lean SEO with free LocalBusiness schema, sitemaps and social cards. Nothing "
"phones home."
msgstr ""
"Enostaven SEO z brezplačno LocalBusiness shemo, zemljevidi strani in "
"družbenimi karticami. Nič ne pošilja podatkov."

msgid "SMTP Mailer"
msgstr "SMTP pošiljatelj"

msgid ""
"WordPress email through your own SMTP server — with an email log, resend, a "
"backup connection and failure alerts."
msgstr ""
"WordPress e-pošta prek lastnega SMTP strežnika — z dnevnikom e-pošte, "
"ponovnim pošiljanjem, rezervno povezavo in opozorili o napakah."

msgid "Social Feed"
msgstr "Družbeni vir"

msgid ""
"An Instagram feed on your site without a Meta token stored in WordPress."
msgstr "Instagram vir na vaši strani brez Meta žetona v WordPressu."

msgid "Reviews Cache"
msgstr "Predpomnilnik ocen"

msgid "Show your Google reviews without putting an API key in WordPress."
msgstr "Prikažite svoje Google ocene brez API ključa v WordPressu."

msgid "Links"
msgstr "Povezave"

msgid ""
"Find broken links and manage redirects on your own server, with the reason "
"for every verdict."
msgstr ""
"Poiščite pokvarjene povezave in upravljajte preusmeritve na lastnem "
"strežniku, z razlogom za vsako odločitev."

msgid "Danadresse Autofill"
msgstr "Danadresse samodejno izpolnjevanje"

msgid ""
"Danish address autocomplete and validation for WooCommerce, WPForms, "
"Gravity, Fluent, Formidable and EDD."
msgstr ""
"Samodokončanje in preverjanje danskega naslova za WooCommerce, WPForms, "
"Gravity, Fluent, Formidable in EDD."

msgid "Soge Lookup"
msgstr "Soge iskanje"

msgid ""
"Look up Danish vehicles (DMR) and companies (CVR) by plate, VIN or CVR "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Iskanje danskih vozil (DMR) in podjetij (CVR) po registrski tablici, VIN ali"
" številki CVR."

msgid "CVR Checkout"
msgstr "CVR blagajna"

msgid ""
"Danish B2B checkout for WooCommerce: CVR company autofill, CVR/EU-VAT (VIES)"
" validation and an EAN/GLN field."
msgstr ""
"Danska B2B blagajna za WooCommerce: samodejno izpolnjevanje podjetja CVR, "
"preverjanje CVR/EU-DDV (VIES) in polje EAN/GLN."

msgid "Danish Shipping"
msgstr "Danska dostava"

msgid ""
"Free pickup point selection for PostNord and GLS Denmark at the WooCommerce "
"checkout, plus clean shipping methods."
msgstr ""
"Brezplačna izbira prevzemne točke za PostNord in GLS Danska pri zaključku "
"nakupa WooCommerce ter čiste dostavne metode."

msgid "API Auth"
msgstr "API avtentikacija"

msgid ""
"JSON Web Tokens for the REST API that you can actually revoke, with scopes "
"and a journal of refusals."
msgstr ""
"JSON spletni žetoni za REST API, ki jih lahko prekličete, z obsegom in "
"dnevnikom zavrnitev."

msgid "Failure alerts by email do not get out"
msgstr "Opozorila o napakah po e-pošti ne bodo poslana"

msgid ""
"The alert email is sent with PHP mail() so that it does not depend on the "
"SMTP server, but PHP mail() failed on this server: %s Use a webhook for "
"alerts, or ask your host to enable mail()."
msgstr ""
"Opozorilno e-poštno sporočilo se pošlje prek PHP mail(), zato ni odvisno od "
"strežnika SMTP, vendar je PHP mail() na tem strežniku spodletel: %s Za "
"opozorila uporabite spletni kavelj (webhook) ali prosite gostitelja, da "
"omogoči mail()."

msgid ""
"This is the previous version of Lynbro SMTP. Lynbro SMTP Mailer has replaced"
" it and uses the same settings. Remove the folder %s with your host's file "
"manager, FTP or SSH — do not use Delete here: its uninstall erases the "
"shared SMTP settings. Lynbro SMTP Mailer keeps a backup and puts them back, "
"but the old plugin also empties the email log."
msgstr ""
"To je prejšnja različica vtičnika Lynbro SMTP. Nadomestil jo je Lynbro SMTP "
"Mailer, ki uporablja iste nastavitve. Mapo %s odstranite z upraviteljem "
"datotek ponudnika gostovanja, prek FTP-ja ali SSH-ja — tukaj ne uporabite "
"možnosti »Izbriši«, saj odstranitev vtičnika izbriše skupne nastavitve SMTP."
" Lynbro SMTP Mailer jih varnostno kopira in obnovi, vendar stari vtičnik "
"izbriše tudi dnevnik e-pošte."

msgid ""
"Your SMTP settings were deleted by another plugin on %s and have been "
"restored from the backup. Nothing for you to do; send a test email if you "
"want to be sure."
msgstr ""
"Drug vtičnik je %s izbrisal vaše nastavitve SMTP, zato so bile obnovljene iz"
" varnostne kopije. Nič vam ni treba storiti; če se želite prepričati, "
"pošljite preizkusno e-poštno sporočilo."

msgid ""
"This site sends with the server's own mail (PHP mail()). The test shows "
"whether the server accepted the email; check its headers in the inbox "
"(Authentication-Results: spf=pass, dmarc=pass)."
msgstr ""
"Ta stran pošilja e-pošto prek lastne pošte strežnika (PHP mail()). Preizkus "
"pokaže, ali je strežnik sprejel e-pošto; v nabiralniku preverite njene glave"
" (Authentication-Results: spf=pass, dmarc=pass)."

msgid ""
"Make sure it includes this web server (its IP address with ip4: or ip6:, or "
"a: / mx: that resolves to it)."
msgstr ""
"Poskrbite, da zapis vključuje ta spletni strežnik (njegov naslov IP z ip4: "
"ali ip6: oziroma zapis a: / mx:, ki kaže nanj)."

msgid ""
"Email is sent with this server's own mail (PHP mail()), from %s, with a "
"matching Return-Path."
msgstr ""
"E-pošta se pošilja prek lastne pošte strežnika (PHP mail()) z naslova %s in "
"z ujemajočim se Return-Path."

msgid ""
"Return-Path is off: the server puts its own address on the envelope, so SPF "
"checks that domain instead of yours."
msgstr ""
"Return-Path je izklopljen: strežnik na ovojnico zapiše svoj naslov, zato SPF"
" preveri to domeno namesto vaše."

msgid "Email is sent with the server's own mail, with a matching sender"
msgstr ""
"E-pošta se pošilja prek lastne pošte strežnika z ujemajočim se pošiljateljem"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP sends with PHP mail() by your choice and sets the From address "
"and Return-Path on every email. Keep this server in the domain's SPF record."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP po vaši izbiri pošilja prek PHP mail() ter pri vsaki e-pošti "
"nastavi naslov From in Return-Path. Ta strežnik vključite v zapis SPF "
"domene."

msgid "This server's own mail (PHP mail(), no SMTP)"
msgstr "Lastna pošta tega strežnika (PHP mail(), brez SMTP)"

msgid ""
"For servers that are set up to send mail themselves. No login needed: the "
"From address and the Return-Path below are still set on every email, so SPF "
"and DMARC can line up. The domain's SPF record must include this server."
msgstr ""
"Za strežnike, ki so nastavljeni za samostojno pošiljanje e-pošte. Prijava ni"
" potrebna: naslov From in spodnji Return-Path sta še vedno nastavljena pri "
"vsaki e-pošti, zato se lahko SPF in DMARC ujemata. Zapis SPF domene mora "
"vključevati ta strežnik."
